    this.roundMap.set('AA.Nen00594',',AA.Nen00594,Ed-U-Games tm,20091213,8,ThStBuGo ThStHi,EnCi,,CuPl,white house;president~s home,,aPRA1_65 zPRA1_30,,,,,US/Presidents,A girl named Esther is the only child of a president to ever be born in the White House.  In what year did this happen?,On 9 Sep 1893` First Lady Frances Cleveland gave birth to Esther Cleveland` her and President Grover Cleveland?s second daughter. Esther is the only child of a president to ever be born in the White House.,Type=Integer LowBracket=1500 Answer=1893 HiBracket=2000,}P.AA.Pi.Th.Sy.Ta.NbrLine1KWidth-1.fD.jpg');
