    this.roundMap.set('AA.Nen00604',',AA.Nen00604,Ed-U-Games tm,20091213,9,ThStBuGo ThStHi,EnCi,,CuPl,white house;president~s home,,aPRA1_65 zPRA1_30,,,,,US/Presidents,In what year was the President~s office layout changed from rectangular to oval?,Though perhaps the most iconic room in the White House` the Oval Office was not used as the President?s personal office until after its renovations in 1902. President Taft was the first to relocate the office to this room and is responsible for changing its shape from rectangular to oval which he did in 1909.,Type=Integer LowBracket=1900 Answer=1902 HiBracket=2000,}P.AA.Pi.Th.Sy.Ta.NbrLine1KWidth-1.fD.jpg');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Nen00605',',AA.Nen00605,Ed-U-Games tm,20091213,9,ThStBuGo ThStHi,EnCi,,CuPl,vice president~s home,,aPRA1_60 zPRA1_30,,,,,US/Presidents,In what year was the Vice President~s Residents first occupied by a Vice President?,Congress established a permanent Vice Presidential residence at Number One Observatory Circle. In 1974` Walter Mondale became the first Vice President to move into the building` and it has since been home to every Vice Presidential family.,Type=Integer LowBracket=1900 Answer=1974 HiBracket=2000,}P.AA.Pi.Th.Sy.Ta.NbrLine1KWidth-1.fD.jpg');
